<title>HUNGARY: CESI index rises, ends at 1,414.70 points.</title>
<headline>CESI index rises, ends at 1,414.70 points.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CESI Central European Share Index rose 9.17 points or 0.65 percent to 1,414.70 points on Friday, the Budapest Stock Exchange said on its Reuters page.</p>
<p>The index reflects trends of 72 Hungarian, Polish, Czech, Slovak and Slovenian shares.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040.</p>
</text>
